/ app-systems: every %!app.X% is the type X, and the plang path, the C# path and the file path say the same thing.
/ This goal is the branch's summary: each stage is a sub-goal, and its steps are the behaviour we want.
/ Each behaviour is a test in spec/<Stage>/ (the coder places them in Tests/AppSystems/<Stage>/). Checks that can't be a
/ .test.goal are in spec/checks.md. A stage is done when its tests pass, its checks hold, and its OBP review is clean.
AppSystems
- call Stage8g          / done: validation that the modifiers-as-clauses logic works
- call Stage8h          / in progress: the builder builds itself, and words compile to what they mean
- call Stage9           / shape: each handler is one line to its owner (worklist + OBP review); one visible payoff
- call Stage10          / %!app holds its types; the app's facts are plang values
- call Stage11          / shape: C# tests reach the app through its own doors; one door to an actor
- call Stage12          / a programmer's mistake is an error result with its own key, never a crash

Stage8g
- each retry of an action gets a fresh deadline                          / Stage8g/RetryGetsAFreshDeadline
- a recovery's result is never served from the cache                     / Stage8g/RecoveryIsNeverCached
- %!data% after an action with a clause is the action's result           / Stage8g/DataIsLeftAloneAfterAClause

Stage8h
- "retry once" is one retry                                               / Stage8h/RetryOnceMeansOneRetry
- "if %done%, return %x%" returns from inside the if                      / Stage8h/IfReturnReturns
- render takes its arguments by name                                      / Stage8h/RenderTakesNamedArguments
- the builder rebuilds its own goals with no reader for the old format    / checks.md
- the decider asks stage 1's common questions, and the eval measures it  / checks.md

Stage9
- a value is born through its type, so "after file create" fires          / Stage9/CreateFiresOnBirth
- every existing test passes; each handler hands over in one line          / checks.md

Stage10
- the app lists its types                                                 / Stage10/AppListsItsTypes
- a plugin's type joins the app                                           / Stage10/PluginTypeJoinsTheApp
- one name, one type: a plugin can't take a built-in's name               / Stage10/OneNameOneType
- the app's facts are plang values                                        / Stage10/AppFactsArePlangValues
- a typed list holds its type                                             / Stage10/TypedListHoldsItsType
- the app's name is its setting                                           / Stage10/AppNameIsItsSetting

Stage11
- one door to an actor: %!app.actor.system%, not %!app.system%           / Stage11/OneDoorToAnActor
- the builder warns about a goal nothing reaches                           / checks.md
- every C# test passes with TestApp and TestAction deleted                 / checks.md

Stage12
- a value that takes no child is an error result                          / Stage12/SetChildOnAValueIsAnError
- an unknown setting is an error result                                   / Stage12/UnknownSettingIsAnError
